# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories.
# vendor/ is intentionally ignored: the physics2d plugin compiles Box2D via cgo using relative
# #include paths that don't survive `go mod vendor`, so we never commit a vendor tree and always
# build with `-mod=mod`. See CLAUDE.md -> Build & run.
vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file
.env

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/

# Claude Code: machine-local permissions only. Shared .claude/commands/ IS committed.
.claude/settings.local.json